		(property "Note" "active-high push-pull EN. SR is held high, so there is no long-push forced off (it needs PB and SR low plus a CSRD capacitor): a hung host is switched off with SW101. PS_HOLD must be high when tON_BLANK ends: 5.6 s min (8.8 typ) on this CM2D variant, VTH+ 3.1 V; the CA2B variant gives only 1.4 s. See C142 / R124 if the host is slower"
